<!-- THE VNG COMMITMENT -->
<section class="cx-guarantee cx-section" id="commitment">
  <div class="cx-container">
    <div class="r">
      <div class="cx-eyebrow">The VNG Commitment</div>
      <h2 class="cx-h2">What we commit to<br>on every single project.</h2>
      <p class="cx-sub" style="max-width:600px">These are not aspirational goals. These are the specific commitments we make to every client at the start of every project, and we hold ourselves accountable to them at every phase.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cx-guarantee-grid stagger">
      <div class="cx-guarantee-item r">
        <div class="cx-guarantee-num">01</div>
        <h3>Itemized Quote, Zero Surprises</h3>
        <p>Your quote will be broken out by trade. Every exclusion will be listed explicitly. Every condition that could affect cost will be flagged before you sign, not after we start. No change order ambushes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-guarantee-item r">
        <div class="cx-guarantee-num">02</div>
        <h3>One Point of Contact, Full Authority</h3>
        <p>You get one PM who owns the whole project and has the authority to solve problems without escalating up a chain. When you call, the person who answers can make decisions. No runaround.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-guarantee-item r">
        <div class="cx-guarantee-num">03</div>
        <h3>Structured Updates, Always</h3>
        <p>You receive structured progress updates on a cadence agreed at project start. Material issues are escalated the same day. You will never need to chase us to find out what is happening on your site.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-guarantee-item r">
        <div class="cx-guarantee-num">04</div>
        <h3>Deadline Protection, Not Deadline Acceptance</h3>
        <p>When a project falls behind, we do not accept the slip. We re-sequence, scale up, extend hours. Your handoff date is a commitment. If we cannot protect it, you hear it from us first, with a plan instead of an apology.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-guarantee-item r">
        <div class="cx-guarantee-num">05</div>
        <h3>Change Orders in Writing, Before We Proceed</h3>
        <p>Every scope change, without exception, is documented in a formal written change order showing cost and schedule impact. You approve it in writing before we do the work. No verbal agreements. No surprises on the final invoice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-guarantee-item r">
        <div class="cx-guarantee-num">06</div>
        <h3>Punch List Closed at Handoff</h3>
        <p>We do our own internal walk before the client walkthrough. The list we hand you is short and actionable. 80% of items close same-day. We do not hand you a 60-item punch list and disappear to the next project.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

